# Club & Grub - World 9, stage 3: "Chieftains' Pyre" in co-op (designer D9b, Book II "The Far Shore").
# The co-op file of w9_l3 (DESIGN.md D.8 / D.10, LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.7): the same climb and pyre hall for two. The
# final-boss stage's co-op gate is its boss form (DESIGN.md D.8 #1): both Rival Chieftains fight at once and a
# knocked-out chieftain's egg hatches in 66 ticks; it cracks only while an active hero other than the smasher keeps
# the other chieftain (or his egg) within 64 px (B.6, G33), so one hero smashes the egg while the other holds the mate
# off. Traits: every tribesman is `lone` (he keeps away from a pair that sticks together and hunts a straggler); the
# Guard is left out (a co-op Guard needs a 4-row hall, LEVEL_DESIGN 15.7.5; G22). P2 starts beside P1. The chieftains
# run on hero physics over resources/bots/w9_l3_coop.json (core-B's baker).

